    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαυγάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>illumine on the surface,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Max.
				26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>look at by the light, examine carefully,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕκαστον ἀκριβέστερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.412
				</span></i>
			; simply, <i>behold,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.58.8
			</span></i> (Antip.): 
				Ep.
			
			aor., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπηυγάσσασθε</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				12.91
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Polystr.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>shine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				4.52b
			</span></i>; 
				f.l.for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ-</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				1.39.1
			</span></i>.</div>
